    "text": "If the expression <math><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math> is positive, then the complete set of values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is"
